      {
        "id": "submit-file",
        "step_content": {
          "type": "file",
          "title": "Предайте калкулатора",
          "instruction": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"bg\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>\nbody{padding:0;max-width:none}.lesson-demo{max-width:100%}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:#25243a;background:#fff;font:20px/1.65 \"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:20px}h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;color:#54316f;margin:24px 0 12px}p{margin:12px 0}li{margin:8px 0}a{color:#553176;overflow-wrap:anywhere}figure{margin:22px 0;padding:12px;background:#f8f5fb;border:1px solid #ded8e8;border-radius:12px}figure img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:auto;max-height:700px;object-fit:contain}figcaption{font-size:16px;color:#54515e;margin-top:10px}.focus,.task,.note{padding:14px 18px;border-left:5px solid #79509b;border-radius:8px;background:#f3edf8}.note{background:#edf6fa;border-color:#387b88}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;font-size:18px}td,th{padding:10px;border:1px solid #d8cfe1;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere}th{background:#f3edf8}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:17px/1.6 Consolas,monospace;background:#f4f1f7;border-radius:8px;padding:14px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}img,svg{max-width:100%;height:auto}details{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}summary{font-weight:600}.mobile-label{display:none}@media(max-width:500px){body{font-size:18px}main{padding:12px}h3{font-size:21px}table,tbody,tr,td,th{display:block;width:100%!important}thead{display:none}tbody tr{border:1px solid #d8cfe1;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0}tbody td,tbody th{border:0;padding:10px 12px}tbody td:first-child{background:#f3edf8;font-weight:600}tbody td+td{border-top:1px solid #e6deed}.mobile-label{display:block;font-weight:600;color:#54316f;margin-bottom:4px}figure{padding:8px}}</style></head><body><main><p>Прикачете един HTML файл с начални стойности 150/12, отделен ред за началната цена, запазени проверки и обновяване на всички резултати при редакция.</p><p class=\"focus\">Запазете и отворете файла повторно. Използвайте бутона за прикачване в тази стъпка и проверете показаното име: <strong>25-javascript.html</strong> (или работното име с вашите инициали). Максимален размер: 20 MB.</p></main></body></html>"
        },
        "step_rules": {
          "time_limit_seconds": 0,
          "ai_feedback": false,
          "allow_ai_hint": false
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-1",
        "step_content": {
          "type": "open_answer",
          "title": "Проверете формулата",
          "instruction": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"bg\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>\nbody{padding:0;max-width:none}.lesson-demo{max-width:100%}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:#25243a;background:#fff;font:20px/1.65 \"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:20px}h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;color:#54316f;margin:24px 0 12px}p{margin:12px 0}li{margin:8px 0}a{color:#553176;overflow-wrap:anywhere}figure{margin:22px 0;padding:12px;background:#f8f5fb;border:1px solid #ded8e8;border-radius:12px}figure img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:auto;max-height:700px;object-fit:contain}figcaption{font-size:16px;color:#54515e;margin-top:10px}.focus,.task,.note{padding:14px 18px;border-left:5px solid #79509b;border-radius:8px;background:#f3edf8}.note{background:#edf6fa;border-color:#387b88}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;font-size:18px}td,th{padding:10px;border:1px solid #d8cfe1;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere}th{background:#f3edf8}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:17px/1.6 Consolas,monospace;background:#f4f1f7;border-radius:8px;padding:14px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}img,svg{max-width:100%;height:auto}details{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}summary{font-weight:600}.mobile-label{display:none}@media(max-width:500px){body{font-size:18px}main{padding:12px}h3{font-size:21px}table,tbody,tr,td,th{display:block;width:100%!important}thead{display:none}tbody tr{border:1px solid #d8cfe1;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0}tbody td,tbody th{border:0;padding:10px 12px}tbody td:first-child{background:#f3edf8;font-weight:600}tbody td+td{border-top:1px solid #e6deed}.mobile-label{display:block;font-weight:600;color:#54316f;margin-bottom:4px}figure{padding:8px}}</style></head><body><main><p>За цена 150 и отстъпка 12% изчислете спестената сума и крайната цена. Покажете действията.</p><p>Отговорете със свои думи. След предаване сравнете с примерния отговор и насоките за самопроверка.</p></main></body></html>",
          "reference_answer": "12/100=0.12; 150×0.12=18 спестени единици; 150×(1−0.12)=132 крайна цена. Екранният текст е 18.00 и 132.00. Проверете дали не изваждате самото число 12 от цената."
        },
        "step_rules": {
          "time_limit_seconds": 0,
          "ai_feedback": false,
          "allow_ai_hint": false,
          "automatic_feedback": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-2",
        "step_content": {
          "type": "open_answer",
          "title": "Защо празното поле не е нула?",
          "instruction": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"bg\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>\nbody{padding:0;max-width:none}.lesson-demo{max-width:100%}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:#25243a;background:#fff;font:20px/1.65 \"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:20px}h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;color:#54316f;margin:24px 0 12px}p{margin:12px 0}li{margin:8px 0}a{color:#553176;overflow-wrap:anywhere}figure{margin:22px 0;padding:12px;background:#f8f5fb;border:1px solid #ded8e8;border-radius:12px}figure img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:auto;max-height:700px;object-fit:contain}figcaption{font-size:16px;color:#54515e;margin-top:10px}.focus,.task,.note{padding:14px 18px;border-left:5px solid #79509b;border-radius:8px;background:#f3edf8}.note{background:#edf6fa;border-color:#387b88}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;font-size:18px}td,th{padding:10px;border:1px solid #d8cfe1;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere}th{background:#f3edf8}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:17px/1.6 Consolas,monospace;background:#f4f1f7;border-radius:8px;padding:14px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}img,svg{max-width:100%;height:auto}details{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}summary{font-weight:600}.mobile-label{display:none}@media(max-width:500px){body{font-size:18px}main{padding:12px}h3{font-size:21px}table,tbody,tr,td,th{display:block;width:100%!important}thead{display:none}tbody tr{border:1px solid #d8cfe1;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0}tbody td,tbody th{border:0;padding:10px 12px}tbody td:first-child{background:#f3edf8;font-weight:600}tbody td+td{border-top:1px solid #e6deed}.mobile-label{display:block;font-weight:600;color:#54316f;margin-bottom:4px}figure{padding:8px}}</style></head><body><main><p>Какво получаваме от valueAsNumber при празно number поле и защо проверяваме преди формулата?</p><p>Отговорете със свои думи. След предаване сравнете с примерния отговор и насоките за самопроверка.</p></main></body></html>",
          "reference_answer": "Получаваме NaN. Number.isFinite връща false; показваме съобщение, насочваме към полето и приключваме чрез return. Нулата е допустимо число и не трябва да се бърка с празен вход."
        },
        "step_rules": {
          "time_limit_seconds": 0,
          "ai_feedback": false,
          "allow_ai_hint": false,
          "automatic_feedback": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "review-3",
        "step_content": {
          "type": "open_answer",
          "title": "Стар резултат след редакция",
          "instruction": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"bg\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>\nbody{padding:0;max-width:none}.lesson-demo{max-width:100%}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;color:#25243a;background:#fff;font:20px/1.65 \"Segoe UI\",Arial,sans-serif}main{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:20px}h3{font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;color:#54316f;margin:24px 0 12px}p{margin:12px 0}li{margin:8px 0}a{color:#553176;overflow-wrap:anywhere}figure{margin:22px 0;padding:12px;background:#f8f5fb;border:1px solid #ded8e8;border-radius:12px}figure img{display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:auto;max-height:700px;object-fit:contain}figcaption{font-size:16px;color:#54515e;margin-top:10px}.focus,.task,.note{padding:14px 18px;border-left:5px solid #79509b;border-radius:8px;background:#f3edf8}.note{background:#edf6fa;border-color:#387b88}.table-wrap{overflow-x:auto}table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;table-layout:fixed;font-size:18px}td,th{padding:10px;border:1px solid #d8cfe1;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;overflow-wrap:anywhere}th{background:#f3edf8}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:17px/1.6 Consolas,monospace;background:#f4f1f7;border-radius:8px;padding:14px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere}img,svg{max-width:100%;height:auto}details{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd}summary{font-weight:600}.mobile-label{display:none}@media(max-width:500px){body{font-size:18px}main{padding:12px}h3{font-size:21px}table,tbody,tr,td,th{display:block;width:100%!important}thead{display:none}tbody tr{border:1px solid #d8cfe1;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin:12px 0}tbody td,tbody th{border:0;padding:10px 12px}tbody td:first-child{background:#f3edf8;font-weight:600}tbody td+td{border-top:1px solid #e6deed}.mobile-label{display:block;font-weight:600;color:#54316f;margin-bottom:4px}figure{padding:8px}}</style></head><body><main><p>След успешно изчисление ученикът променя процента на 101. Какво трябва да стане с двата изходни реда?</p><p>Отговорете със свои думи. След предаване сравнете с примерния отговор и насоките за самопроверка.</p></main></body></html>",
          "reference_answer": "При input старите резултати се заменят с указание за ново изчисление. При submit има грешка за диапазона, а редът за началната цена не трябва да показва стар валиден резултат. Сравнете съобщенията и фокуса, не само крайната цена."
        },
        "step_rules": {
          "time_limit_seconds": 0,
          "ai_feedback": false,
          "allow_ai_hint": false,
          "automatic_feedback": true
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "summary",
